            "review_title": "Review at Mr. Ya Bon Cafe",
            "review_text": "Cigaroftheday\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam123 contributions\n0\naverage crepe\nApr 2019 • Friends\nWell i think the subject line says it all. Not saying anyThing bad nor knocking them. Crepe is crepe, and they did a good iob, service was average, wasn’t memoriable. The afogato i order, the scoop of ice cream was very small. Coffee was ok, not spectacular. They do have an indoor sitting area where youre not out in the heat. Very clean inside.\nWritten April 25, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
