            "review_title": "Review at Mr. Ya Bon Cafe",
            "review_text": "uyenanhnguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam20 contributions\n0\nEasily the best crepes in Saigon\nJul 2018 • Family\nI used to go to La Creperie for crepes but since they moved to another location, I thought I need to give up the love for crepes. Until I found this place...\n\nA simple crepe place run by a lovely lady, yet the crepe here is served perfectly. Batter is soft and crispy, ingredients are always fresh. Dont forget to try the sweet crepe with a scoop of salted caramel ice cream! Pure goodness!\nRead more\nWritten July 23, 2018",
