            "review_title": "Review at Mr. Ya Bon Cafe",
            "review_text": "Nhi L\n4 contributions\n0\nBest place for crepes\nApr 2018 • Couples\nThis is absolutely the best place for crepes in HCMC for me. Genuine French style. High quality for every single time I visit (yes, I'm a loyal customer here, visiting at least twice a month). Highly recommend Caramel Salted Butter Crepe and Shrimp Salad. The owner is really friendly and cares much about customer satisfaction.\nWritten April 10, 2018",
